2026-10-30T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Recording a live run: house recorder at 4K, CineForm, no FFmpeg tool
 # uuid: 7efce4ce-c51c-589f-90bf-620e51881785
 # tags: rfd:title
 RFD:Committed  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-10-30T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2349) 'one way to record a run where a live model plays
 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2349) 'every recording of a live run in the workspace, first the decider games
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2349) 'A live run is recorded at 4K, in CineForm, with the house recorder.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Movie Maker renders at a fixed frame rate, so the game waits for the model and the video hides its latency. A video of a live model must show the latency it has.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Read RFD66606-2345 for the format this RFD amends.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2349) 'The recorder, the codec, the check and what is open
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2349) 'A live run is recorded with the house recorder on the Mac at a 3840x2160 canvas. The recorder writes CineForm video and FLAC audio in Matroska through its custom output. The game runs on the wall clock and never waits for the model. Godot Movie Maker is blocklisted. FFmpeg never runs as a tool. RFD66606-2345's format stands; this RFD replaces its encoder, its live recorder and its file check.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2349) '- RFD66606-2345, the video format, which this RFD amends; RFD66606-2347, the decider-pong review.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2349) '- The private blocklist, which lists Movie Maker and FFmpeg as a tool.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2349) '- The private manifest's issue on the parked Snake video, which records the rulings and the house recorder test.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2349) 'The operator's rulings, 2026-10-09 and 2026-10-10
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2349) '- The recorder is the house recorder. Movie Maker is blocklisted.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2349) '- The video is 3840x2160. 2K is denied.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2349) '- A video holds at least 2 minutes of real run time. A short run is made longer by running longer, never by holding or repeating frames.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2349) '- The game ticks on the wall clock. A late reply applies at the next tick. With no reply the game takes its default move.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2349) '- CineForm everywhere. No ProRes is written and converted to CineForm.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2349) '- FFmpeg never runs as a tool, and headless Godot never runs.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2349) 'How the house recorder writes CineForm
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2349) 'The house recorder's current release ships the `cfhd` CineForm encoder. Its custom output, built on FFmpeg, is set to Matroska with `cfhd` video and FLAC audio. In a still-frame test every frame decoded through the CineForm SDK at 39.4 dB against the input. The control, the same input shifted 40 px, scored 16.3 dB.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Encoding outside the house recorder
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2349) 'A render that is not a live capture encodes with the CineForm SDK through the engine's CineForm module or the CineForm interactor. Delivery uses the AV1-in-Matroska interactor's `deliver.exs`. It rewraps the frames byte for byte and checks every frame and sample.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2349) '- A render reel records through the engine's movie writer straight to CineForm. It writes no PNG frames to encode later (operator, 2026-10-17).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2349) '- Large media and videos are kept on the Windows desk, not on the Mac mini, which sits on a remote network (operator, 2026-10-17). A render made on the Mac is copied to the desk, its size is read back there, and only then is the Mac copy deleted.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2349) 'How a file is checked
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2349) '`deliver.exs` checks every frame and every sample. `av1mkv dump-frame` pulls frames, and a person looks at them. The run's length is gated from the frames' own timestamps, and a short frame set is the control that must fail. The frames and samples are the check, whatever exit code the recorder returns.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2349) 'Still open
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2349) '- The house recorder's custom output uses FFmpeg's encoder inside the recorder. The ruling bans FFmpeg as a tool, and the Snake video issue records the house recorder as the route. The operator has not ruled on whether the licence reason reaches the house recorder.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2349) '- The decider-pong recorders named in RFD66606-2345 still call `ffmpeg`. They move to the house recorder or the SDK route when that project is next worked on.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2349) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2349) 'RFD66606-2345 encodes with the homebrew `ffmpeg` and checks files with `ffprobe`. FFmpeg as a tool is now banned.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2349  1 LINE
 Text:Written
